WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
If you want country, that usually means giving up luxury.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
There's three reasons why this house changes the game.

00:06.000 --> 00:09.000
And stick around, because the last one is going to surprise you.

00:14.000 --> 00:18.000
Reason number one, this house sits on 11 acres and it feels like a luxury penthouse.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
You have beautiful windows throughout that bring the nature from the outside in.

00:22.000 --> 00:26.000
Everything is high-end from the appliances, the countertops.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
You have beautiful stone that goes all the way to the ceiling.

00:29.000 --> 00:32.000
And very tall ceilings that make it feel like it's open to the sky.

00:32.000 --> 00:35.000
Reason number two, this is where you get the country.

00:35.000 --> 00:38.000
You have beautiful views of the valley, you can see Chimney Rock.

00:38.000 --> 00:43.000
It has a massive shop with multiple lofts, multiple bays, and it has a safe room.

00:43.000 --> 00:46.000
Reason number three, the most unexpected.

00:46.000 --> 00:51.000
This house has 300 feet of packed river frontage, making this home a waterfront house.

